node_modules/
dist/
# Depth-agnostic: a leading-path pattern like `.dockg/cache/` is anchored to
# this file's directory, so a run inside test/fixtures/ would leak its cache
# into a tracked fixture. `**/` matches wherever the command was run.
**/.dockg/
# Derived, binary, and not CI-regenerable (model weights are a download).
# Build them in your deploy pipeline instead of committing them. One sidecar per
# language since ADR 01038, so this matches the whole family rather than a
# single name — the goldens under test/fixtures/golden/ are mock-embedded and
# committed deliberately, and are not under a `kg/` directory.
**/kg/vectors.*.bin
*.tsbuildinfo
.tmp/
# Astro's build cache for the docs site. `node_modules/` and `dist/` above are
# unanchored and already match docs/'s copies at any depth; this one is not.
**/.astro/
